 --version\n      - if: unix\n        then: crush --version | grep \"crush version ${{ version | replace('.', '\\\\.') }}\"\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - crush\n      files:\n        - if: unix\n          then:\n            - share/bash-completion/completions/crush\n            - share/fish/vendor_completions.d/crush.fish\n            - share/zsh/site-functions/_crush\n      strict: true\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush\n  summary: The glamourous AI coding agent for your favourite terminal 💘\n  description: |\n    Your new coding bestie, now available in your favourite terminal.\n    Your tools, your code, and your workflows, wired into your LLM of choice.\n  license: FSL-1.1-MIT AND MIT\n  license_file:\n    - src/LICENSE.md\n    - library_licenses/\n    - freetype_license/LICENSE\n    - segmentio_asm_license/LICENSE\n    - chroma_license/COPYING\n  documentation: https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/charmbracelet/crush\n  repository: https://github.com/charmbracelet/crush\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - pavelzw\n",
